%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date 2026-07-24
%% @type sequence
%% @level system
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as CLI User
    participant Router as CLI Router
    participant Bootstrap as Bootstrap Service
    participant Config as Config Loader
    participant Pipeline as Pipeline Service
    participant Lock as Lock Service
    participant Transformer as Transformer
    participant Writer as Storage Writer
    participant Metrics as Metrics/Tracing
    participant Cleanup as Cleanup Service

    Note over CLI, Cleanup: Pipeline Execution Sequence

    %% CLI Invocation Phase
    CLI->>Router: bioetl run <pipeline> <config>
    Router->>Router: Parse CLI arguments
    Router->>Config: Load pipeline config
    Config->>Config: Validate YAML schema
    Config-->>Router: Validated config
    Router->>Bootstrap: Initialize DI container
    Bootstrap->>Bootstrap: Register services (ports, adapters)
    Bootstrap->>Metrics: Initialize logger/metrics/tracer
    Metrics-->>Bootstrap: Observability bundle
    Bootstrap-->>Router: Ready composition root

    %% Pipeline Instantiation Phase
    Router->>Pipeline: Create pipeline instance
    Pipeline->>Config: Load effective config
    Config-->>Pipeline: Effective config artifact
    Pipeline->>Metrics: Emit pipeline_start metric
    Pipeline->>Metrics: Start pipeline tracing span

    %% Lock Acquisition Phase
    Pipeline->>Lock: Request lock (pipeline_id, run_id)
    Lock->>Lock: Check lock availability
    alt Lock available
        Lock->>Lock: Acquire lock
        Lock-->>Pipeline: Lock acquired
    else Lock held
        Lock-->>Pipeline: Lock denied
        Pipeline->>Metrics: Emit lock_denied metric
        Pipeline->>CLI: Return error (lock held)
    end

    %% Data Extraction Phase
    Pipeline->>Transformer: Instantiate transformers
    Transformer->>Config: Load transformer configs
    Config-->>Transformer: Transformer configs
    Pipeline->>Transformer: Execute extraction
    Transformer->>Transformer: Read source data
    Transformer->>Metrics: Emit extraction_start metric
    Transformer->>Metrics: Start extraction span
    Transformer->>Transformer: Apply business logic
    Transformer->>Metrics: Emit extraction_complete metric
    Transformer-->>Pipeline: Extracted data

    %% Transformation Phase
    Pipeline->>Transformer: Apply transformations
    Transformer->>Metrics: Emit transformation_start metric
    Transformer->>Metrics: Start transformation span
    Transformer->>Transformer: Apply schema validation
    Transformer->>Transformer: Apply data quality rules
    Transformer->>Metrics: Emit transformation_complete metric
    Transformer-->>Pipeline: Transformed data

    %% Silver Write Phase
    Pipeline->>Writer: Write Silver data
    Writer->>Metrics: Emit silver_write_start metric
    Writer->>Metrics: Start silver_write span
    Writer->>Writer: Write to Delta Lake (Silver)
    Writer->>Writer: Apply DQ validation
    alt DQ validation passes
        Writer->>Writer: Commit to Silver
        Writer-->>Pipeline: Silver write success
    else DQ validation fails
        Writer->>Writer: Route to quarantine
        Writer->>Metrics: Emit quarantine_write metric
        Writer-->>Pipeline: Quarantine routing
    end
    Writer->>Metrics: Emit silver_write_complete metric

    %% Gold Write Phase
    Pipeline->>Writer: Write Gold data
    Writer->>Metrics: Emit gold_write_start metric
    Writer->>Metrics: Start gold_write span
    Writer->>Writer: Apply strict validation (ADR-018)
    alt Strict validation passes
        Writer->>Writer: Commit to Gold
        Writer-->>Pipeline: Gold write success
    else Strict validation fails
        Writer->>Metrics: Emit gold_validation_failed metric
        Writer-->>Pipeline: Gold write failed
    end
    Writer->>Metrics: Emit gold_write_complete metric

    %% Error Handling Phase
    alt Extraction error
        Transformer->>Metrics: Emit extraction_error metric
        Transformer->>Metrics: Record error in span
        Transformer-->>Pipeline: Extraction error
    else Transformation error
        Transformer->>Metrics: Emit transformation_error metric
        Transformer->>Metrics: Record error in span
        Transformer-->>Pipeline: Transformation error
    else Write error
        Writer->>Metrics: Emit write_error metric
        Writer->>Metrics: Record error in span
        Writer-->>Pipeline: Write error
    end

    %% Cleanup and Shutdown Phase
    Pipeline->>Metrics: Emit pipeline_complete metric
    Pipeline->>Metrics: Finish pipeline span
    Pipeline->>Lock: Release lock
    Lock->>Lock: Clear lock ownership
    Lock-->>Pipeline: Lock released
    Pipeline->>Cleanup: Run cleanup operations
    Cleanup->>Cleanup: Close connections
    Cleanup->>Metrics: Flush metrics
    Cleanup->>Metrics: Close tracer
    Cleanup-->>Pipeline: Cleanup complete
    Pipeline-->>CLI: Pipeline execution result

    Note over CLI, Cleanup: End of Pipeline Execution Sequence


## Key Components

### CLI Phase
- **CLI Router**: Parses arguments and routes to appropriate pipeline
- **Config Loader**: Validates YAML schemas and loads configuration
- **Bootstrap Service**: Initializes DI container and observability

### Pipeline Phase
- **Pipeline Service**: Orchestrates the complete pipeline lifecycle
- **Lock Service**: Manages lock acquisition for idempotent execution
- **Transformer**: Applies business logic and transformations
- **Storage Writer**: Handles Silver/Gold writes with DQ validation

### Observability
- **Metrics/Tracing**: Provides structured logging, metrics, and distributed tracing
- **Error Handling**: Comprehensive error classification and reporting

### Cleanup
- **Cleanup Service**: Ensures proper resource cleanup and shutdown

## ADR References

- **ADR-010**: Local-Only Deployment — no external orchestration required
- **ADR-015**: Pipeline Services Lifecycle — service instantiation and management
- **ADR-018**: Gold Strict Validation — mandatory validation before Gold writes
- **ADR-023**: Entity Type Patterns — standardized entity naming and structure
- **ADR-032**: UnifiedHTTP Client — consistent HTTP client usage
- **ADR-040**: Diagram Governance — diagram metadata and quality standards
